{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yYDrqKTLwg1794302231.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區主要股市造好。</p><p></p><p>日本和台灣股市連升第二日。科技股向好，鎧俠和軟銀升百分之9至13。</p><p></p><p>韓國股市終止三連跌，反彈逾百分之4。兩大權重股三星電子，和SK海力士升約百分之4至6。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市延續上日升勢，再升逾百分之1，突破9,100點關口。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.157458+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:30:37.170624+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:01.380455+00:00","content_hash":"6706448aa870b0b13e7537805a4591cb3b9523b2cad17a696299d7acd055d334","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.157458+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}